# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Hand-cut 2026-11-07 (Alliance 12-20 zone order): an Eastern Kingdoms loop between Darkshore's
# northern loops (03-darkshore, to about 18) and its southern ones (03-darkshore-return, from
# about 20), where Loch Modan's and Redridge's 15-20 quests still give full XP. Before, the
# route had no Loch Modan visit after the starts, did Redridge's 15-18 quests at 24 for a
# fraction of their XP, never took the Defias chain past Wiley, and entered Ashenvale at 20
# with a grind there.
#
# Flow: the boat to Menethil Harbor -> the Wetlands road and Dun Algaz -> Loch Modan from the
# north: the Algaz Station and the Silver Stream Mine, the Stonewrought Dam, the loch's
# toolbox, Thelsamar (flight path), Ironband's Excavation, the Farstrider Lodge and its hunts,
# Thelsamar, Ylva's banner and the tunnel post -> Dun Morogh -> Ironforge (flight path) ->
# the tram -> Stormwind -> Elwynn -> Redridge: Three Corners, Lakeshire (flight path) and the
# loop west and south of the lake -> the walk west through Goldshire (Smith Argus) to Sentinel
# Hill -> Stormwind by gryphon (Shaw, General Marcus) and back -> Moonbrook (People's Militia
# part 2 and Alba's crates, moved here from 02-westfall's second half), the lighthouse, the
# traitor's escort -> the gryphon to Lakeshire -> the gnoll hills north of the lake ->
# Lakeshire, then back to Auberdine: the gryphon to Stormwind (Sprite Jumpsprocket, Baros Alexston
# for Expanding Horizons, whose reply goes to Thundris where the boat lands) and the boat, or the
# Hearthstone (still bound there since the first Darkshore visit).
# The Westfall stretch needs The Defias Brotherhood (65) from 02-westfall: a player who loads
# this guide without it goes from Goldshire to Stormwind's gate (General Marcus) and flies
# back to Lakeshire instead.
#
# Crocolisk Hunting (385) rides on the lodge stops: Loch Crocolisks drop its meat and skins
# (players' recordings: skins and meat looted in Loch Modan, hand-ins at about 17).
# Left out:
# A Dark Threat Looms (161) goes on to Ashlan Stonesmirk at Whelgar's dig, three levels later.
# Mountaineer Stormpike's Task and Stormpike's Order (1339, 1338): Kadrell's breadcrumb, and
# the route reaches Stormpike from the north first (Filthy Paws, 307, has no prerequisite).
# The tunnel post's trogg chain (224, 237, 263, 217): sixty trogg kills and four trips between
# the post and Stonesplinter Valley. Bingles (2039, 2038): Find Bingles starts in Ironforge.
# Mercenaries and Vyrin's Revenge (255, 271): elite. Keeper of the Flame (103): its flasks come
# from the harvest golems around Sentinel Hill after Captain Grayson gives it, a second
# lighthouse trip. Messenger to Westfall and Darkshire (143, 145): another round trip each.
# Marshal Marris's Blackrock quests (20, 98387), Alther's Mill (98386) and Murloc Poachers (150,
# from 20) are taken here, at their givers, and done on the 24 visit (04-redridge-mountains), where
# level 20-21 quests still give full XP. Givers passed and left for later, by level: A Watchful Eye
# (94, from 20: players pass the Tower of Azora at 19-20, and its statue is worked on the 24 visit,
# where Theocritus gives it), Mathias and the Defias for Rogues (2360, from 20: a Human Rogue is
# 19.x on the SI:7 stop; 06-ashenvale's Stormwind stop gives it),
# Solomon's Law (91, level 23; Galardell's Shadowhide gnolls are 23-25, worked at 24), Blackrock Bounty and An Unwelcome Guest (128, 34: levels 24-25),
# the Wanted posters (elites, 24+), and on the boat into Menethil The Greenwarden, Young Crocolisk
# Skins and Spoils of War (463, 484, 98197: level 21-22, 3+ over at 18.7; taken at 22-24).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Loch Modan

step Boat to Menethil Harbor
  zone Darkshore
  tip Sell and repair in Auberdine first: the next stretch is a long one.
  vendor nearest optional
  goto 32.4,43.8 "Boat to Menethil Harbor"

step Menethil Harbor
  zone Wetlands
  tip Off the boat, walk up the pier to the flight master by the inn. Nothing to take here yet: Menethil's quests are for your Wetlands visit at about 22.
  getfp "Menethil Harbor"

step Into Loch Modan
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Follow the road east out of Menethil and south through the Dun Algaz pass. Keep to the road: the Wetlands crocolisks and raptors beside it are over your level.
  goto 25.6,10.5 "Into Loch Modan"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- North Loch Modan

step Algaz Station
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  tip Mountaineer Stormpike stands at the Algaz Station, at the south end of the pass.
  accept 307                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike

step Silver Stream Mine
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  tip East along the hills to the mine: the Miners' League crates sit in its tunnels among the Tunnel Rat kobolds.
  collect 2640 quest 307                      -- Miners' Gear, from the crates; below ground

step Back to the Algaz Station
  only Human,NightElf,Skyborne
  turnin 307                                  -- Mountaineer Stormpike

step Stonewrought Dam
  tip Chief Engineer Hinderweir stands on top of the dam, up the ramp at its west end.
  accept 250                                  -- Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII

step The Suspicious Barrel
  tip Walk east along the dam, down its eastern ramp, then back west along the foot of the dam on the land side: two Dark Iron Sappers guard the barrel. Kill them, then open the barrel: it ends this quest and starts the next.
  turnin 250                                  -- Suspicious Barrel
  accept 199

step Stonewrought Dam
  turnin 199                                  -- Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Thelsamar

step The loch
  tip South along the west shore. The Discarded Fishing Toolbox lies on the loch bed at one of several places: east of Thelsamar (48.1,39.7), a little south-west of there (45.7,43.4), or at the south end of the loch (48.7,54.4 or 50.6,53.3). If it isn't at the arrow, try the next place. Click it for the quest; the Monogrammed Silver Hair Clip comes with it.
  accept 86614                                -- Discarded Fishing Toolbox; underwater

step Thelsamar
  tip Khara Deepwater stands on the shore north-east of town, Jern Hornhelm by the inn.
  turnin 86614                                -- Khara Deepwater
  accept 436                                  -- Jern Hornhelm

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironband's Excavation

step Ironband's Excavation
  tip Round the south end of the loch and head east to the dig. Magmar Fellhew and Prospector Ironband stand together at its west edge.
  turnin 436                                  -- Magmar Fellhew
  accept 297
  accept 298                                  -- Prospector Ironband

step The dig site
  tip Stonesplinter Diggers, Geomancers and Berserk Troggs hold the dig east of Ironband; any of them can drop a Carved Stone Idol. Piles of Excavation Tools lie around the dig: open one and right-click the tools to start Excavation Tools, then gather six.
  tip Careful: Berserk Troggs (19-20) enrage below 40% health.
  collect 278049 x1                           -- Excavation Tools: open a pile at the dig
  accept 86613                                -- Right-click the Excavation Tools
  collect 2636 quest 297                      -- Carved Stone Idol
  collect 278398 quest 86613                  -- Excavation Tools

step Ironband's Excavation
  turnin 297                                  -- Magmar Fellhew
  turnin 86613                                -- Prospector Ironband

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Farstrider Lodge

step The Farstrider Lodge
  tip North-east to the lodge on the hill. Marek Ironheart stands inside, Daryl the Youngling outside.
  accept 86758                                -- Marek Ironheart, inside
  accept 385                                  -- Marek Ironheart: the loch crocolisks below the lodge
  accept 257                                  -- Daryl the Youngling: 15 minutes

step Mountain Buzzards
  tip Mountain Buzzards circle the hills west and south of the lodge, back toward the dig. A Hunter's Boast runs for 15 minutes.
  kill 1194 quest 257                         -- Mountain Buzzard

step Daryl the Youngling
  turnin 257
  accept 258                                  -- 12 minutes

step Elder Mountain Boars, Daggerfang and the loch crocolisks
  tip The Elder Mountain Boars roam the hills north-west of the lodge, along the east shore: A Hunter's Challenge runs for 12 minutes, so the boars come first. Daggerfang, a crocolisk, patrols the shore below them among the Loch Crocolisks.
  kill 1192 quest 258                         -- Elder Mountain Boar
  collect 279591 quest 86758                  -- Marek's Croc-Hunting Knife: Daggerfang
  collect 2924 quest 385                      -- Crocolisk Meat: Loch Crocolisks
  collect 2925 quest 385                      -- Crocolisk Skin

step The Farstrider Lodge
  turnin 258                                  -- Daryl the Youngling
  turnin 86758                                -- Marek Ironheart, inside
  turnin 385

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South to the tunnel

step Thelsamar
  tip Back west along the south shore to Thelsamar: Jern Hornhelm by the inn, then Thorgrum Borrelson with the gryphons on the west side of town, on the way south.
  turnin 298                                  -- Jern Hornhelm
  accept 301                                  -- For Prospector Stormpike in Ironforge
  getfp "Thelsamar" npc 1572

step Mountaineer Ylva
  tip South of Thelsamar, Ylva lies dead in the mouth of a trogg cave. Take her banner, raise it beside her and hold the spot: troggs come in waves from both sides, then Headsplitter.
  accept 86585                                -- Mountaineer Ylva
  kill 269185 quest 86585                     -- Headsplitter

step The tunnel post
  tip West to the dwarven post at the tunnel to Dun Morogh.
  turnin 86585                                -- Captain Rugelfuss

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Into Dun Morogh
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Through the South Gate tunnel and west along the road to Ironforge.
  goto 86.0,49.6 "Into Dun Morogh"

step Into Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  goto 21.6,77.8 "Into Ironforge"

step Ironforge
  zone Ironforge
  tip Gryth Thurden keeps the gryphons in the Great Forge; Prospector Stormpike is in the Hall of Explorers, north-east of it, on the way to the tram in Tinker Town.
  getfp "Ironforge" npc 1573                  -- Gryth Thurden, in the Great Forge
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  vendor nearest optional
  turnin 301                                  -- Prospector Stormpike, Hall of Explorers

step Tram to Stormwind
  zone Ironforge
  goto 78.0,51.4 "Tram to Stormwind"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Redridge

step Elwynn Forest
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip From the tram, leave Stormwind by the main gate and follow the road through Goldshire and east through Elwynn to Redridge.
  goto 65.2,69.7 "The road east to Redridge"

step Guard Thomas
  only NightElf
  zone Elwynn Forest
  when onquest 35
  tip Guard Thomas guards the bridge on this road east, past the Tower of Azora: Marshal Dughan's Further Concerns, from your walk through Goldshire, goes to him.
  turnin 35                                   -- Guard Thomas, on the bridge

step Three Corners
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip The road crosses into Redridge at Three Corners. Guard Parker walks around the crossroads.
  accept 244                                  -- Guard Parker walks around Three Corners: look inside the circle on the map

step Lakeridge Highway
  tip Follow the road along the south shore of Lake Everstill to the gryphon master. Deputy Feldon stands by the road next to her.
  getfp "Lakeshire"
  turnin 244                                  -- Deputy Feldon
  accept 98407
  accept 246

step Lakeshire
  tip Cross the long bridge north into town: Shawn and Hilary play by the shore at its north end, Foreman Oslow and Marshal Marris stand there too, Verner Osgood by the smithy, Magistrate Solomon in the town hall, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, Wiley the Black upstairs in the inn and Darcy and Chef Breanna inside it.
  accept 3741                                 -- Shawn
  accept 125                                  -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 20                                   -- Marshal Marris: the Blackrock camps are for your next Redridge visit, at about 24
  accept 98387
  accept 118                                  -- Verner Osgood: for Smith Argus in Goldshire
  accept 120                                  -- Magistrate Solomon, in the town hall: for General Marcus Jonathan in Stormwind
  accept 127                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  turnin 65                                   -- Wiley the Black, in the inn; upstairs
  accept 132
  accept 129                                  -- Darcy, inside
  accept 92                                   -- Chef Breanna, inside

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- West and south of the lake

step Guard Parker
  tip West along the road to Three Corners first; the gnolls are on the way back east.
  turnin 129                                  -- Guard Parker walks around Three Corners: look inside the circle on the map
  accept 130

step Lakeridge Highway: kill these as you meet them
  zone Redridge Mountains
  tip Redridge Mongrels and Thrashers hold the hills east of Three Corners, north of the road; Poachers camp south of the road. Great Goretusks root around the same hills and Dire Condors circle south of the lake; Tarantulas crawl round Three Corners.
  collect 280911 quest 98407                  -- Spiked Collar: Redridge Thrashers
  kill 423 quest 246                          -- Redridge Mongrel
  kill 424 quest 246                          -- Redridge Poacher
  collect 2296 quest 92                       -- Great Goretusk Snout
  collect 1080 quest 92                       -- Tough Condor Meat
  collect 1081 quest 92                       -- Crisp Spider Meat: Tarantulas

step Deputy Feldon
  tip East along the road to the gryphon master; Deputy Feldon stands beside her.
  turnin 246
  turnin 98407

step Sunken Chest
  tip Back toward town, swim east from the bridge into Lake Everstill; the chest lies on the lake bed beside a sunken boat. Murloc Flesheaters and Tidecallers line the south shore around it: any of them can carry a Spotted Sunfish.
  collect 1309 quest 125                      -- Oslow's Toolbox; underwater
  collect 1467 quest 127                      -- Spotted Sunfish

step Hilary's Necklace
  tip Then west under the bridge: a Glinting Mud mound on the lake bed beside town holds the necklace. Only one mound shows at a time, anywhere from under the dock to past the bridge.
  collect 10958 quest 3741                    -- Hilary's Necklace; underwater

step Lakeshire
  tip Through town east to west: Hilary and Foreman Oslow at the north end of the bridge, Dockmaster Baren on the docks, then Martie's garden at the west end; Darcy and Chef Breanna are in the inn.
  turnin 3741                                 -- Hilary
  turnin 125                                  -- Foreman Oslow
  accept 89                                   -- Its pikes and rivets come from the gnolls north of the lake, on the loop after Westfall
  turnin 127                                  -- Dockmaster Baren
  turnin 130                                  -- Martie Jainrose
  accept 131
  turnin 131                                  -- Darcy, inside
  turnin 92                                   -- Chef Breanna, inside

step Dockmaster Baren
  when level>=20
  tip From level 20 Dockmaster Baren gives Murloc Poachers: take it now if he offers it (otherwise on the last Lakeshire stop). Its murlocs are for your next Redridge visit, at about 24.
  accept 150 optional                         -- Dockmaster Baren, on the docks

