step Moonbrook and the Defias hills
  when turnedin 65
  tip Defias Pathstalkers and Knuckledusters walk Moonbrook; Highwaymen (level 17) patrol the hills south and east of it in pairs: pull them apart. The Deadmines entrance in the smithy is a group dungeon.
  tip Careful: The camps in the hills hold mixed groups of Defias, so it is easy to pull more than one at a time if you are low level.
  kill 121 quest 14
  kill 449 quest 14
  kill 122 quest 14
  collect 254676 quest 92747.1                -- Suspicious Industrial Supplies, from the crates around Moonbrook

step The Defias Messenger
  when turnedin 65
  tip South along the road to Moonbrook. The Defias Messenger starts in front of the Moonbrook smithy and walks north to the Gold Coast Quarry and the back of the Jangolode Mine, then back: look along his road. Slow him when he runs at 30% health.
  collect 1381 quest 142                      -- A Mysterious Message: the Defias Messenger

step Westfall Lighthouse
  when turnedin 65
  tip South-west from Moonbrook to the lighthouse on the point: Captain Grayson waits on its steps. Old Murk-Eye walks the beach and the shallows north-east of it among the murlocs: pull him away from the Oracles.
  accept 104                                  -- Captain Grayson
  collect 3636 quest 104 @33.7,83.9 map 1436 live -- Scale of Old Murk-Eye: Old Murk-Eye, on the beach north-east of the lighthouse
  turnin 104                                  -- Captain Grayson

step Sentinel Hill
  when turnedin 65
  tip Back north up the road to Sentinel Hill. The Defias Traitor waits at the foot of the tower ramp; if he is missing, someone is escorting him and he is back within minutes.
  turnin 142                                  -- Gryan Stoutmantle
  accept 155                                  -- The Defias Traitor
  turnin 14
  turnin 92747                                -- Alba Fairmoon
  accept 92748

step The Defias Traitor
  when turnedin 65
  tip Stay with the traitor as he walks south to Moonbrook; he does not stop for fights, so clear what follows him. His walk ends at the Defias hideout below Moonbrook.
  complete 155 @55.7,47.5                     -- The Defias Traitor, at the foot of the tower ramp

step Sentinel Hill
