  kill 430 quest 124                          -- Redridge Mystic
  collect 2856 quest 89                       -- Iron Pike
  collect 1013 quest 89                       -- Iron Rivet
  collect 1221 quest 122                      -- Underbelly Whelp Scale: Black Dragon Whelps

